---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200/80 text-slate-600 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start justify-between gap-8 text-center md:text-left">
      <!-- Brand & Info -->
      <div class="max-w-sm">
        <a href={baseUrl} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-slate-900 font-extrabold text-base tracking-tight mb-2 group">
          <img
            src={`${baseUrl}logo-128.webp`}
            alt="STORIQ Logo"
            width="28"
            height="28"
            class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg shadow-xs group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-150 object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <span>STORIQ</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mt-1">
          Content Repurposing Engine berbasis storytelling. Satu ide cerita, puluhan format konten siap pakai.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-2">
          100% Gratis • Tanpa Login • Open Source di GitHub
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Nav Links -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">
        <a href={`${baseUrl}framework/`} class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Fitur</a>
        <a href={`${baseUrl}panduan/`} class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Dokumentasi</a>
        <a href={`${baseUrl}roadmap/`} class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Roadmap</a>
        <a href={`${baseUrl}kontribusi/`} class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Kontribusi</a>
        <a href={`${baseUrl}generator/`} class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Generator</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/andrean-lp/storiq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright & License -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-3 text-xs text-slate-400">
      <p>© {year} Dibuat oleh <a href="https://andrean-lp.github.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-600 font-medium">Andre Wahyu Hermawan</a> • Lisensi MIT.</p>
      <p class="italic text-[11px] text-slate-400">"Satu ide bisa berkembang lebih jauh dari yang kamu bayangkan."</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
